rose. If the shortlist is sound but the story is unclear, work on the evidence bank and statement of purpose. If the written application is submitted, move to interview preparation rather than repeatedly rewriting old documents."}],"$L67"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],"$L68","$L69","$L6a"]}]
